WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.647
A decade of Auditor General findings.

00:00:02.647 --> 00:00:07.045
Over nine point three billion dollars wasted on the Phoenix Pay System alone.

00:00:07.045 --> 00:00:09.500
Ninety-three million on ArriveCAN.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:14.625
Six point nine billion in confirmed CERB fraud during 2020 and 2021.

00:00:14.625 --> 00:00:20.579
Billions in lapsed spending every year — departments unable to spend their allocated funds by fiscal year end.

00:00:20.579 --> 00:00:24.113
No meaningful recovery mechanisms for identified waste.

00:00:24.113 --> 00:00:27.840
The same procurement failures documented year after year after year.

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:30.454
The Auditor General's office writes the reports.

00:00:30.454 --> 00:00:32.420
Parliament receives the reports.

00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:33.840
Nothing changes.

00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:35.340
The cycle repeats.

00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:37.113
The findings accumulate.

00:00:37.113 --> 00:00:38.704
The money disappears.

00:00:38.704 --> 00:00:42.045
And the next audit finds the same problems the last one did.
